#. translators: %d: how big the preview is drawn, in percent
#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:68
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Shown at %d%% of its size so that it fits here: on your site it will look "
"bigger."
msgstr "Es mostra al %d %% de la mida perquè hi càpiga: al vostre lloc web es veurà més gran."

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:83
msgid ""
"Weather for more than 200,000 places, without an API key. There are three "
"ways to add it:"
msgstr "El temps de més de 200.000 llocs, sense clau d’API. Hi ha tres maneres d’afegir-lo:"

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:86
msgid "Block"
msgstr "Bloc"

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:87
msgid ""
"In the editor, add the “Weather Widget Pro” block, search for your city and "
"choose what to show in the block sidebar."
msgstr "A l’editor, afegiu el bloc «Weather Widget Pro», cerqueu la vostra ciutat i trieu què voleu mostrar a la barra lateral del bloc."

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:91
msgid "Widget"
msgstr "Giny"

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:92
msgid ""
"Go to Appearance > Widgets (or the Customizer) and add “Weather Widget Pro” "
"to a sidebar. If your theme has no widget areas, use the block or the "
"shortcode."
msgstr "Aneu a Aparença > Ginys (o al Personalitzador) i afegiu «Weather Widget Pro» a una barra lateral. Si el tema no té zones de ginys, utilitzeu el bloc o el codi curt."

#: includes/WIYCW-admin.php:94
msgid "Go to Widgets"
